      <data key="d2">_shelf</data>
      <data key="d10">_shelf</data>
      <data key="d11">function</data>
      <data key="d3">repo2graph/export.py</data>
      <data key="d5">python</data>
      <data key="d12">198</data>
      <data key="d13">216</data>
      <data key="d14">def _shelf(nodes, sizes, pad: float = 24.0):</data>
      <data key="d15">Row-pack the boxes for graphs too big to force-lay-out in Python.

    Rows are filled in node order, which keeps a file next to the symbols it
    defines, and boxes cannot overlap, so no separation pass is needed.</data>
