      <data key="d5">python</data>
      <data key="d12">24</data>
      <data key="d13">43</data>
      <data key="d14">def _rmtree(path: Path) -&gt; None:</data>
      <data key="d15">Best-effort recursive delete of a temp clone.

    Git marks pack files under .git/objects read-only; on Windows os.unlink then
    raises PermissionError and shutil.rmtree(ignore_errors=True) would leave the
    whole clone (often hundreds of MB) behind. Clear the bit and retry.</data>
      <data key="d4">
        <y:ShapeNode>
          <y:Geometry x="1075.63" y="3123.88" width="73.12" height="29.25" />
          <y:Fill color="#57C7E3" transparent="false" />
